<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Inspector Dispatch System — TrueScale Docs</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ts-dark: #001e2b;
            --ts-green: #00ed64;
            --ts-green-dark: #00684a;
            --ts-green-light: #e8fff1;
            --ts-gray-50: #f8fafc;
            --ts-gray-100: #f1f5f9;
            --ts-gray-200: #e2e8f0;
            --ts-gray-600: #475569;
            --ts-radius: 16px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--ts-gray-50);
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            min-height: 100dvh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Top Header */
        header {
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            padding: 0 clamp(16px, 5vw, 48px);
            height: 72px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .logo-img {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-nav {
            padding: 9px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: white;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: var(--ts-gray-100);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--ts-dark);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #003043;
        }

        /* Container */
        .assignment-section {
            width: min(94%, 1100px);
            margin: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px) auto;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 60px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 44px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .heading {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
        }

        .heading h1 {
            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .heading p {
            font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            line-height: 1.55;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Process Flow Grid */
        .process-flow {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
        }

        .process-item {
            background: var(--ts-gray-50);
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: 24px 18px;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .process-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: var(--ts-green);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 237, 100, 0.12);
        }

        .icon-circle {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--ts-green-light);
            border: 1.5px solid #c7f3d6;
            color: var(--ts-green-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .process-item h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .process-item p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Smart Assignment Banner */
        .bottom-area {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 50%, #edfbf2 0%, #ffffff 80%);
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .smart-assignment h2 {
            font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 24px);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .smart-point {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            font-size: 14.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .smart-point span {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            background: #d1fae5;
            color: #047857;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .illustration-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .illustration-card i {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: var(--ts-green-dark);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .illustration-card h4 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .illustration-card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            nav {
                display: none;
            }

            .bottom-area {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Top Header -->
    <header>
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo.jpeg" alt="TrueScale Logo" class="logo-img">
            <span>TrueScale</span>
        </a>
        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/docs/digital-certificate">Certificate Flow</a>
            <a href="/docs/digital-verification">Digital Verification</a>
            <a href="/docs/inspector-assignment" class="active">Inspector Dispatch</a>
            <a href="/docs/qr-verification">QR Verification</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/login" class="btn-nav btn-outline">Log In</a>
            <a href="/signup" class="btn-nav btn-primary">Get Started</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="assignment-section">
        <div class="heading">
            <h1>Intelligent Inspector Assignment</h1>
            <p>Automated geolocation-based allocation ensuring faster on-site verifications, reduced travel overheads, and balanced workload distribution.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-flow">
            <div class="process-item">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Request Created</h3>
                <p>Owner applies for equipment verification with location coordinates.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="process-item">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Location Match</h3>
                <p>System cross-references State and District jurisdictional limits.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="process-item">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Inspector Assigned</h3>
                <p>Qualified field officer receives immediate calendar notifications.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="process-item">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Visit Scheduled</h3>
                <p>Owner and inspector synchronize on a confirmed inspection window.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bottom-area">
            <div class="smart-assignment">
                <h2>Why Smart Dispatch Works</h2>
                <div class="smart-point">
                    <span>✓</span>
                    <p>Automated territory-based routing by state and district</p>
                </div>
                <div class="smart-point">
                    <span>✓</span>
                    <p>Load-balanced field officer task distribution</p>
                </div>
                <div class="smart-point">
                    <span>✓</span>
                    <p>Live schedule sync and real-time reschedule handling</p>
                </div>
                <div class="smart-point">
                    <span>✓</span>
                    <p>Real-time SMS & email notifications for both parties</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="illustration-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-route"></i>
                <h4>Regional Dispatch Engine</h4>
                <p>Ensuring compliance adherence and minimal verification turnaround time across India.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>